{"ok":true,"schema":"figure-series-descriptions@1","key":"FIG-df80ceaebcc8aa29","lines":["### 1. Diagrammtyp & Architektur-Kontext","UML-Klassendiagramm aus dem AUTOSAR-Standard (ECU Resource Template). Das Diagramm spezifiziert die Metamodell-Struktur für Peripherie-Hardwareelemente (`Peripheral`) und deren physikalische bzw. logische Hardware-Ports (`HWPort`) zur Anbindung an Speicher, Controller und Interrupt-Controller.","","### 2. Komponenten, Entitäten & Schnittstellen","Das Diagramm definiert folgende Entitäten und Beziehungen:","* **Peripheral** (Spezialisierung/Typ: `HWElement`):","  * Attribut: `+ canBeDisabled: Boolean [0..1]`","* **PeripheralHWPort** (Spezialisierung/Typ: `HWPort`):","  * Attribute:","    * `+ inversion: Boolean [0..1]`","    * `+ wakeUpCapability: Boolean [0..1]`","    * `+ powerOnCapability: Boolean [0..1]`","* **Buffer**:","    * `+ number: Int [0..1]`","    * `+ type: Enumeration{input, output, inout}`","    * `+ size: Int`","* **MemoryMappedHWPort** (Spezialisierung/Typ: `HWPort`):","    * `+ dataInterfaceWidth: Int`","    * `+ hwPortType: Enumeration{unspecified, data, control}`","* **InterruptProduceHWPort** (Spezialisierung/Typ: `InterruptHWPort`):","  * Keine eigenen Attribute aufgeführt.","Beziehungen:","* Komposition von `PeripheralHWPort` zu `Buffer` mit Rollenbezeichnung `+buffer` und Multiplizität `0..*`.","* Gerichtete gestrichelte Pfeile von `Peripheral` zu:","  * `MemoryMappedHWPort`","  * `PeripheralHWPort`","  * `InterruptProduceHWPort` mit Stereotyp/Rollenbezeichnung `status report`.","### 3. Dynamisches Verhalten & Sequenzablauf","Statisches Metamodell ohne dynamische Sequenzabläufe. Die gerichteten Abhängigkeiten verdeutlichen die Zuordnung von Schnittstellenports zu einer Peripheriekomponente sowie die Weiterleitung von Statusberichten über `InterruptProduceHWPort`.","### 4. Normative Relevanz & Entwickler-Hinweise","Relevant für die Modellierung und Konfiguration von Mikrocontroller- und Peripherie-Hardware-Ressourcen in AUTOSAR ECU Resource Descriptions. Definiert erforderliche Hardwaredaten wie Portbreite (`dataInterfaceWidth`), Port-Typisierung, Pufferkonfiguration (`Buffer`) sowie Eigenschaften zur Deaktivierung (`canBeDisabled`) und Energieverwaltung (`wakeUpCapability`, `powerOnCapability`)."],"versions":[{"id":"FIG-df80ceaebcc8aa29","releases":["R2.1.20"],"l":[0,1,2,3,4,2,5,6,7,8,9,10,11,12,8,13,14,15,16,8,17,18,19,20,2,21,22,23,24,25,26,2,27,28,2,29,30,2],"model":"gemini-3.8-flash (via agy)","at":"2026-10-08","recipe":"figure-series@1"},{"id":"FIG-98fd2cd80ae5a3a7","releases":["R3.0.7"],"l":[0,1,2,3,4,2,5,6,7,8,9,10,11,12,8,13,14,15,16,8,17,18,19,20,2,21,22,23,24,25,26,2,27,28,2,29,30,2],"model":"gemini-3.8-flash (via agy)","at":"2026-10-08","recipe":"figure-series@1"},{"id":"FIG-911466a4c1cafc9e","releases":["R3.1.5"],"l":[0,1,2,3,4,2,5,6,7,8,9,10,11,12,8,13,14,15,16,8,17,18,19,20,2,21,22,23,24,25,26,2,27,28,2,29,30,2],"model":"gemini-3.8-flash (via agy)","at":"2026-10-08","recipe":"figure-series@1"},{"id":"FIG-6283d2ee8a7e63e3","releases":["R3.2.3"],"l":[0,1,2,3,4,2,5,6,7,8,9,10,11,12,8,13,14,15,16,8,17,18,19,20,2,21,22,23,24,25,26,2,27,28,2,29,30,2],"model":"gemini-3.8-flash (via agy)","at":"2026-10-08","recipe":"figure-series@1"}],"trans":[{"from":"FIG-df80ceaebcc8aa29","to":"FIG-98fd2cd80ae5a3a7","fr":"R2.1.20","tr":"R3.0.7","change":"keine","md":"Keine inhaltlichen Änderungen erkennbar.","model":"gemini-3.8-flash (via agy)"},{"from":"FIG-98fd2cd80ae5a3a7","to":"FIG-911466a4c1cafc9e","fr":"R3.0.7","tr":"R3.1.5","change":"keine","md":"Keine inhaltlichen Änderungen erkennbar.","model":"gemini-3.8-flash (via agy)"},{"from":"FIG-911466a4c1cafc9e","to":"FIG-6283d2ee8a7e63e3","fr":"R3.1.5","tr":"R3.2.3","change":"keine","md":"Keine inhaltlichen Änderungen erkennbar.","model":"gemini-3.8-flash (via agy)"}]}